{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56529","headline":"还丹歌 · 贺兰求","name":"还丹歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青龙起，白虎卧，玄武飞，朱雀坐，黄龙中央自结里。\n母怜子，子怜母，炉中结成云一朵。\n（《金液还丹百问诀》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贺兰求","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56529.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56529","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}